    {
      "id": "18476905162107722",
      "text": "Unpopular opinion: dzikir pagi petang itu bukan soal rutin — tapi soal hadir.\nAku dulu baca cepet, pikiran ke mana-mana,",
      "permalink": "https://www.threads.com/@_iame.hijrah/post/DciCnh6jYsA",
